Underlying company figures come from Anthropic, PBC's public Form S-1 filed with the
U.S. SEC on October 26, 2026, and from press reporting as noted in datasets.json.
Analyst-estimate datasets (risks, product_priorities, forecast_assumptions) are
illustrative and not investment advice.
